          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 79126,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir wissen, wie man Code mit einer <code>while</code>-Schleife wiederholt. Wie dieses Programm, das Anweisungen wiederholt, um die amerikanische Flagge anzuzeigen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"first_counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first_counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  first_counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"second_counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" second_counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  second_counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mit <strong>for-Schleifen</strong> können wir Programme mit viel weniger Code schreiben und es anderen Programmierern leichter machen, sie zu verstehen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79131,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um eine <code>for</code>-Schleife wie diese zu erstellen, fügen wir das <code>for</code>-Schlüsselwort, eine Variable wie <code>i</code>, das Wort <code>in</code> und schließlich <code>range():</code> hinzu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range():\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>for</code>, gefolgt von <code>i</code> und schließlich <code>in</code>, <code>range():</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79130,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In einer <code>for</code>-Schleife können wir mit der <code>range()</code>-Anweisung angeben, wie oft unsere Schleife ausgeführt werden soll.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy birthday to you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>range</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79128,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Das Hinzufügen einer Zahl wie <code>6</code> innerhalb von <code>range()</code> bedeutet, dass die Schleife den Codeblock 6 Mal durchläuft, von <code>0</code> bis <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>range</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>6</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Zahl in <code>range()</code> legt fest, wie oft die Schleife ausgeführt wird, beginnend bei <code>0</code>. Lass sie <code>0</code> bis <code>5</code> ausgeben.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>range</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code>, <code>6</code> und schließlich <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Variable vor <code>in</code>, in diesem Fall <code>i</code>, ist die Zählvariable. Sie zählt, bei welcher Wiederholung der Schleife wir uns gerade befinden.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For loops are great!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>i</code>, gefolgt von <code>i</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Variable vor <code>in</code>, hier <code>i</code>, ist die Zählvariable. Sie zählt, bei welcher Wiederholung der Schleife du bist.</p><p>Gib den Zähler aus, sodass <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> und <code>2</code> jeweils vor <code>For loops are great!</code> erscheinen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For loops are great!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>i</code>, gefolgt von <code>i</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For keyword",
            "id": 79124,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Art von Schleife hat dies?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Are you ready?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eine <code>for</code>-Schleife</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Eine <code>while</code>-Schleife</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eine <code>for</code>-Schleife.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dieser Code verwendet eine <code>for</code>-Schleife. Warum erscheint <code>Are you ready?</code> viermal?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Are you ready?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Schleife läuft einmal für jeden von <code>range(4)</code> erzeugten Wert.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Eine <code>for</code>-Schleife läuft unabhängig von ihrem Wertebereich immer viermal.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die Zählvariable <code>i</code> gibt die Nachricht viermal aus, bevor die Schleife beginnt.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Schleife läuft einmal für jeden von <code>range(4)</code> erzeugten Wert.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 79123,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wohin kommt die Schleifenvariable in einer <code>for</code>-Schleife?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Vor dem <code>in</code>-Schlüsselwort</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nach der <code>range()</code>-Anweisung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Vor dem <code>in</code>-Schlüsselwort.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die Schleifenvariable in einer <code>for</code>-Schleife steht vor dem <code>in</code>-Schlüsselwort.</p><p>Welcher Kopf verwendet <code>step</code> als Schleifenvariable für drei Wiederholungen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for step in range(3):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for in step range(3):</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for range(3) in step:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>for step in range(3):</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 79122,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Variable ist die Zählvariable der <code>for</code>-Schleife? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>range</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>i</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In dieser <code>for</code>-Schleife ist <code>i</code> die Zählvariable.</p><p>Wenn <code>print(i)</code> innerhalb der Schleife stünde, welche Werte würde es ausgeben?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code>, dann <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>, dann <code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>range</code>, dann <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>0</code>, dann <code>1</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 79121,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie oft wird <code>be like me</code> in der Konsole erscheinen?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody wants to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody wants to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">3</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">4</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle 3 aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Änderung würde dafür sorgen, dass <code>be like me</code> viermal erscheint und der Rest des Codes unverändert bleibt?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody wants to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody wants to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ändere <code>range(3)</code> zu <code>range(4)</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Verschiebe <code>print(\"Everybody wants to\")</code> in die Schleife.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ändere <code>range(3)</code> zu <code>range(2)</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ändere <code>range(3)</code> zu <code>range(4)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing",
            "id": 79120,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist falsch an diesem Code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es fehlt die Zählervariable nach dem <code>for</code>-Schlüsselwort</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mit dem Code ist nichts falsch</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es fehlt die Zählervariable nach dem <code>for</code>-Schlüsselwort.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine <code>for</code>-Schleife benötigt eine Zählvariable nach dem <code>for</code>-Schlüsselwort.</p><p>Welche Ersetzung korrigiert die erste Zeile, sodass <code>i</code> beim Ausführen der Schleife existiert?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for i in range(5):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for range(5) in i:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for i range(5):</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>for i in range(5):</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: For keyword",
            "id": 79118,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Baue die Struktur einer <code>for</code>-Schleife zusammen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating accounts...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>for</code>, gefolgt von <code>i</code> und schließlich <code>range</code>, <code>(4)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Baue den Schleifenkopf so zusammen, dass er viermal ausgeführt wird und bei jedem Durchlauf <code>Updating accounts...</code> ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating accounts...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(5)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>for</code>, gefolgt von <code>i</code>, <code>range</code> und schließlich <code>(4)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Counter variable",
            "id": 79117,
